      "node_id": "kg_doc_7",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Nimavar school (Persian: مسجد نیماور‎ ‎ ) is a historical school in Isfahan, Iran. It's located in Nimavar Bazaar and belongs to Safavid era. This school was built in 1691 in the era of Suleiman I.",
