      "node_id": "kg_doc_2",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "The Old Bazaar (Albanian: \"Pazari i vjetër\" ; Serbian: Стари базар / \"Stari bazar\" ) in Gjakova is the oldest bazaar in Kosovo (also known as \"Çarshia e Madhe\" (Grand Bazaar) or \"Dakovica\". Mëhalla e Hadumit, the historical neighborhood where it is located also houses the city's oldest mosque, the Hadum Mosque (\"), which dates from the 15th century.",
